 		Beyond the structured, computable data available in DiagnosticReport and Observation, metadata about the analysis performed is captured in the <a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/HL7/cg-incubator/StructureDefinition-GenomicStudy.html">GenomicStudy</a> resource. GenomicStudy aims at delineating relevant information of a genomic study. A genomic study might comprise one or more analyses, each serving a specific purpose. These analyses may vary in method (e.g., karyotyping, CNV, or SNV detection), performer, software, devices used, or regions targeted.
 		</p>
