+		When referencing genomic analysis from an Observation, the <code>derivedFrom</code> attribute MAY be used to reference a DocumentReference when the observation was derived from the data in the file, even when that file was produced as part of a GenomicStudy output. The base Observation resource does not include GenomicStudy as a direct target for <code>partOf</code> or <code>derivedFrom</code>; follow the linked GenomicStudy guidance for any additional linkage patterns.
